This directory is iced_tiny_skia 0.14.1 from crates.io with two changes: the iced commit 0553559827c99b8c80563375f5fa6bbe1edce597 ("Clip quad shadows in `tiny-skia` renderer"), and `draw_quad` computes the shadow pixels only in the clip bounds and not under the fill of an opaque quad. Delete this directory and its [patch.crates-io] entry in the root Cargo.toml when an iced release contains both changes.
